entries:
I finally caught up with you...
And look how far you've come already!{VAR BE01}
Professor Juniper said that you were
probably headed for Striaton City by now.{VAR BE01}
I have another present for you.
{VAR 0100 0000}! Try these on!{VAR BE01}

When you're wearing the Running Shoes,
you can go anywhere in a flash!{VAR BE01}
Let me read you the instructions...{VAR BE01}
“Hold the B Button to run faster than
normal. Put on the Running Shoes and{VAR BE00}
tear around to your heart's content!"{VAR BE01}
That's what it says.{VAR BE01}
I bought these a long time ago
and stashed them away somewhere.{VAR BE01}
I found them when I was cleaning up.
Guess it's good to clean occasionally!{VAR BE01}

{VAR 0100 0000}, you understand that
you're never really alone, right?{VAR BE01}
You're with Pokémon, you have friends,
and you're always in my thoughts.{VAR BE01}
That's all right, then. Enjoy your trip!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Hey, listen!
Let's have a Pokémon battle!{VAR BE01}
Pleeeease? The Pokémon I caught
have become a little stronger!{VAR BE01}
Ready or not, here I come!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Woo-hoo!{VAR BE01}
You are a tough cookie, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
I'm gonna work hard on training my
Pokémon so we won't lose anymore!{VAR BE00}
OK, bye-bye!{VAR BE01}

Hey, you!{VAR BE01}
I'm gonna do something amazing!
Wanna watch?

Hey! Were you watching?{VAR BE01}
You can take a shortcut by
jumping off ledges! Amazing, eh?

When your Pokémon don't have
enough energy to fight...{VAR BE00}
Just walk on the road!{VAR BE01}
Pokémon only appear in the tall grass!

entries.text:
Trainer Tips!{VAR BE01}

Pokémon that participate in battle
receive Exp. Points.{VAR BE01}
Have your Pokémon battle often,
and make them stronger and stronger!
